  "highlight": "Elaine Kornbau Howley crossed the English Channel from England to France in 13 hours 55 minutes on 3 August 2009.",
  "biography": [
    "Howley crossed Catalina in 2008, circled Manhattan in June 2009 and finished the English Channel that August. Alongside her swimming she became a writer on the sport and helped found the Massachusetts Open Water Swimming Association.",
